; This is the primary routine for handling deficiency lists within the VistA system.
; It provides several entry points for different actions related to incomplete records tracking (IRT).
;

8d269108: ;
; Handles the creation of new records or updates to existing records.
; It allows for selection from a list and then processes the chosen items.
;

f7c563f9: ;
; Initiates the creation of a new record or the update of an existing record.
; It performs setup tasks and moves to the category and type selection.
;

c27a997b: ;
; Handles the case where no records match the criteria for the current list or action.
; It sets up a placeholder message indicating the absence of records.
;
